2. When long-pressing/holding an exercise (to add it to the deck): the dragged/held card should have the same style as deck exercise cards in grid mode, regardless of the display mode chosen in Minha coleção.

3. The respective deck slot (1 to 8) should be the exercise's slot in the deck — currently the exercise always goes into the next available ordered number (if slots 1 and 2 are occupied, the next occupies position 3). Hmm, wait. This means: when dragging an exercise onto a specific empty slot? Let me parse: "o respectivo espaço de no deck (de 1 a 8) deve ser o espaço do exercício no deck (atualmente o exercício sempre fica no próximo número ordenado disponível (se os exercicios 1 e 2 estiverem com exercicios o proximo ocupa a posição 3)". 

I think there is a mapping between the collection card order/position and deck slots? Or: each exercise in the collection has a position number; when held, the placeholder slot in the deck should be its slot. Hmm.

Let me read the code: `MontarTab.tsx`, `cards.tsx`, `treinos-store.ts`, `treinos-helpers.ts`, and the legacy `montar.js`/`secao-treinos.js`. Need context. Let me look.

Also check the system_map for MontarTab (mentioned in entries v4.32.0). Let's explore.

